            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las alertas en segundo plano están conectadas mediante APNs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For reliable vehicle alerts with the app closed, run the push microservice on the same always-on host as TeslaMate. A TestFlight install uses production APNs; after saving, this screen must say “Push connected”." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For reliable vehicle alerts with the app closed, run the push microservice on the same always-on host as TeslaMate. A TestFlight install uses production APNs; after saving, this screen must say “Push connected”."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para recibir alertas fiables del vehículo con la app cerrada, ejecuta el microservicio push en el mismo equipo siempre encendido que TeslaMate. TestFlight usa APNs de producción; después de guardar, esta pantalla debe indicar «Push conectado»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Journey history" : {
