    "For complete cleanup, open Controls › Locks on the Tesla screen and remove the read-only key that was added for this iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "For complete cleanup, open Controls › Locks on the Tesla screen and remove the read-only key that was added for this iPhone." } },
        "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Para completar la eliminación, abre Controles › Cerraduras en la pantalla del Tesla y elimina la clave de solo lectura añadida para este iPhone." } }
      }
    },
    "For guaranteed alerts (Sentry/security) with the app closed, run the optional push microservice (see /server). Native APNs push only works on Xcode/TestFlight builds — sideloaded (AltStore) installs are signed without the push entitlement and can never receive it. For those, point the service at ntfy or a Home Assistant webhook instead: same instant alerts, no Apple account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For guaranteed alerts (Sentry/security) with the app closed, run the optional push microservice (see /server). Native APNs push only works on Xcode/TestFlight builds — sideloaded (AltStore) installs are signed without the push entitlement and can never receive it. For those, point the service at ntfy or a Home Assistant webhook instead: same instant alerts, no Apple account."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para avisos garantizados (Sentry/seguridad) con la app cerrada, ejecuta el microservicio de push opcional (ver /server). El push nativo APNs solo funciona en builds de Xcode/TestFlight: las instalaciones sideloaded (AltStore) se firman sin el entitlement de push y nunca podrán recibirlo. En ese caso, apunta el servicio a ntfy o a un webhook de Home Assistant: mismos avisos instantáneos, sin cuenta de Apple."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Format" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Format"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Formato"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found %lld car(s) via TeslaMateApi" : {
