    "On-device alerts are silenced during this window (e.g. overnight). A possible Sentry event can still alert you — that 3 AM warning is usually the one you want." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On-device alerts are silenced during this window (e.g. overnight). A possible Sentry event can still alert you — that 3 AM warning is usually the one you want."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los avisos locales se silencian durante esta ventana (p. ej. de noche). Un posible evento Sentry puede seguir avisándote: ese aviso de las 3 AM suele ser justo el que quieres."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On-device local alerts. iOS can't reliably poll 24/7 in the background — for guaranteed alerts with the app closed, run the optional push microservice (see README)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
