    "The Sentry alert fires when the screen state becomes “Sentry banner (7)”. To verify end-to-end: arm Sentry, keep this screen open, and walk up to the car — the row should flip within seconds. TeslaMate polls every ~30 s, so very brief banners can be missed; with the app closed, alerts need the push service or ntfy (see Data → README)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Sentry alert fires when the screen state becomes “Sentry banner (7)”. To verify end-to-end: arm Sentry, keep this screen open, and walk up to the car — the row should flip within seconds. TeslaMate polls every ~30 s, so very brief banners can be missed; with the app closed, alerts need the push service or ntfy (see Data → README)."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El aviso Sentry salta cuando la pantalla pasa a “Banner Sentry (7)”. Para verificarlo de extremo a extremo: arma Sentry, deja esta pantalla abierta y acércate al coche — la fila debería cambiar en segundos. TeslaMate sondea cada ~30 s, así que banners muy breves pueden perderse; con la app cerrada, los avisos necesitan el servicio push o ntfy (ver Datos → README)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The VIN could not be obtained from TeslaMate API." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The VIN could not be obtained from TeslaMate API." } },
        "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "No se pudo obtener el VIN desde la API de TeslaMate." } }
      }
    },
    "The backup holds your server settings and credentials, locked with a password only you know — AES-256 encrypted. Keep the password safe: it can't be recovered." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The backup holds your server settings and credentials, locked with a password only you know — AES-256 encrypted. Keep the password safe: it can't be recovered."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La copia contiene la configuración del servidor y las credenciales, protegidas con una contraseña que solo tú conoces — cifrada con AES-256. Guarda bien la contraseña: no se puede recuperar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The backup includes your server settings and credentials so a second device can be set up without retyping. Keep it private." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The backup includes your server settings and credentials so a second device can be set up without retyping. Keep it private."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La copia incluye la configuración del servidor y las credenciales para configurar otro dispositivo sin volver a teclear. Mantenla privada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The car is showing the Sentry banner (center display state 7) near %@. This is inferred — any clip is on the car's USB and isn't available via TeslaMate." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The car is showing the Sentry banner (center display state 7) near %@. This is inferred — any clip is on the car's USB and isn't available via TeslaMate."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El coche muestra el aviso de Sentry (estado de pantalla 7) cerca de %@. Es una inferencia: cualquier clip está en el USB del coche y no está disponible vía TeslaMate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current parking session when available." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The current parking session when available."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La sesión de estacionamiento actual cuando esté disponible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The private key is hardware-protected on this iPhone and is never sent to TeslaMate, Tesla servers or any other device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The private key is hardware-protected on this iPhone and is never sent to TeslaMate, Tesla servers or any other device." } },
        "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "La clave privada está protegida por hardware en este iPhone y nunca se envía a TeslaMate, a los servidores de Tesla ni a ningún otro dispositivo." } }
      }
    },
    "The private key will be destroyed immediately. Tesstats will no longer be able to authenticate with this vehicle." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The private key will be destroyed immediately. Tesstats will no longer be able to authenticate with this vehicle." } },
        "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "La clave privada se destruirá inmediatamente. Tesstats dejará de poder autenticarse con este vehículo." } }
      }
    },
    "The secure Bluetooth connection could not be established." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The secure Bluetooth connection could not be established." } },
        "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "No se pudo establecer la conexión Bluetooth segura." } }
      }
    },
    "The selected vehicle was not found nearby. Wake and unlock it, keep this iPhone inside the vehicle, and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The selected vehicle was not found nearby. Wake and unlock it, keep this iPhone inside the vehicle, and try again." } },
        "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "No se encontró cerca el vehículo seleccionado. Actívalo y desbloquéalo, mantén este iPhone dentro del vehículo y vuelve a intentarlo." } }
      }
    },
    "The vehicle is already using all available Bluetooth connections. Move other phone keys or key fobs away, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The vehicle is already using all available Bluetooth connections. Move other phone keys or key fobs away, then try again." } },
        "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "El vehículo ya está usando todas las conexiones Bluetooth disponibles. Aleja otras llaves de teléfono o llaveros y vuelve a intentarlo." } }
      }
    },
    "The vehicle did not accept the read-only key." : {
